{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is MonMae?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MonMae (MonTamer Maker)</strong> is the ultimate monster-taming game builder \u2014 now on Steam! This is a game and tool made specifically for creating your own monster-catching RPGs from scratch, no coding required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft, play, and <strong>share</strong> your own full-length games or bite-sized adventures with the Steam community using our powerful yet beginner-friendly tools and massive art libraries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MonMae comes with a short tutorial and example game to get you up to speed on crafting an RPG of your own using our plethora of game assets that are included!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What comes with my purchase?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MonMae gives you everything you need out of the box to make a full monster-tamer RPG:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ monsters with both battle and overworld sprites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ NPCs with animations and variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ original music tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 playable characters with full animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive tile sets, from grassy fields to mega cities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full UI sets and battle animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ customizable moves and example scripts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual editors for maps, dialogue, events, battles, and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re making a 5-minute side quest or a 40-hour epic, MonMae has you covered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2555470?t=1766294210","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2555470?t=1766294210","capsule_im