 sets and battle animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ customizable moves and example scripts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual editors for maps, dialogue, events, battles, and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re making a 5-minute side quest or a 40-hour epic, MonMae has you covered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Yanako RPGs"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555470/c702d4a5ae56227060bf059d50e36071aee6766f/header.jpg?t=1766294210","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2555470/1549024043/12227755e327ed753a65e7edeebea0ea12fd6a8c/1750799900/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750801893","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2555470/1549024043/12227755e327ed753a65e7edeebea0ea12fd6a8c/1750799900/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750801893","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2555470/1549024043/12227755e327ed753a65e7edeebea0ea12fd6a8c/1750799900/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750801893","id":257160846,"name":"Steam Page Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257160846/54728f9841b5f3726c4eb9f29fd5c08492f6072b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750801893"}],"name":"MonTamer Maker","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li>